                "description": "Baldwin's Wave Lever with Classic rose is versatile. It would look great in almost any home. It is made from forged brass and is available in a variety of finishes. A wide array of functions--including passage, privacy, and dummy--make it easy to find just what you're looking for. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches; and it is designed to conceal a 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled door.",
